# Reuse Before Create

Before creating components, hooks, utils, types, constants, icons, helpers, services, layouts, animations, or style utilities:

1. Check `docs/knowledge/REUSABLE_INVENTORY.md`
2. Search `src/components/`, `src/hooks/`, `src/lib/`, `src/data/`, `public/assets/`
3. Reuse or extend existing implementations
4. Create new files only when existing ones cannot support the need

Prefer shared components over page-specific markup. Do not duplicate logic or styles. Put new files in the correct folder (`ui` / `layout` / `sections` / `cards` / `forms`).
